{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80Descend Into The Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a world that shouldn\u2019t exist \u2014 rotting halls, whispering corridors, and the echoes of your own guilt. <i>Saint of Chains</i> is a <strong>psychological survival horror FPS\u00a0</strong>where the line between memory and reality dissolves. Every step drags you closer to the truth\u2026 and the dread buried within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/c45872ab178908c255ed27ea6b2275ac.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/c45872ab178908c255ed27ea6b2275ac.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/c45872ab178908c255ed27ea6b2275ac.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Move Quietly,\u00a0 Breathe Slowly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouch, <strong>jump-and-crouch</strong> \u2014 the classic trick from the <strong>old days</strong> \u2014 and drag your way through a decaying, impossible world that feeds on guilt, anxiety, neglect, and over-ambition. Every sound matters. Every breath betrays you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/90b50ca3062fdf53e26f292fb5912f43.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/90b50ca3062fdf53e26f292fb5912f43.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/90b50ca3062fdf53e26f292fb5912f43.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2a Hit Hard. Miss Once. Die Loud</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pipes. Guns. Axes</strong>. Panic. Every fight is ugly - loud - desperate. Scarce ammo boxes lie half-empty in the dark. <strong>You\u2019re no hero</strong>. You\u2019re just trying to survive what\u2019s left of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a0878599dfb17d85791b3513f4375449.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a0878599dfb17d85791b3513f4375449.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a0878599dfb17d85791b3513f4375449.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Think Like a Victim. Solve Like It\u2019s the Only Way Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted locks. <strong>Cryptic clues</strong>. Cold statues, and the sick logic of the damned and the unforgiven. Some puzzles open doors. Others open memories you swore you\u2019d buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/caa8b072eb7d44df0154be44bb957de8.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/caa8b072eb7d44df0154be44bb957de8.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/caa8b072eb7d44df0154be44bb957de8.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca2 The World Hates You Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality folds into something that knows your name. Run, hide, or pray \u2014 it doesn\u2019t matter. It\u2019s already inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a4039c4a5eefe67ef7d751295f2909fa.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a4039c4a5eefe67ef7d751295f2909fa.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a4039c4a5eefe67ef7d751295f2909fa.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Retro Horror - Reborn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to <strong><i>Silent Hill 3</i>, <i>Lost in Vivo</i>, <i>Condemned: Criminal Origins</i></strong>, and <strong><i>Cry of Fear.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in the haunting visual style of the <strong>PS2 / Xbox360</strong> era \u2014 when every shadow felt alive, and every step sounded like a confession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f WHAT YOU\u2019RE GETTING:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience</strong> 2000s-inspired psychological horror reborn for the modern age</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> with scarce ammo and desperate melee and ranged combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve</strong> puzzles that blur sanity and logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> surreal, decaying environments filled with symbolic monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> a story about guilt, obsession, and the chains we forge ourselves</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079340?t=1760720910","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/b739497a22a966948d34247e7e6aedfb7cae5e2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760720910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/81adb00c066c4221133be5f9bb24fa5f93a1b46a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760720910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/81adb00c066c4221133be5f9bb24fa5f93a1b46a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760720910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains non-realistic depictions of violence, religious themes, and frequent scary imagery."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/fb31e9ee1e009c0acb9bc513843669c9.avif?t=1760720910\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80Descend Into The Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a world that shouldn\u2019t exist \u2014 rotting halls, whispering corridors, and the echoes of your own guilt. <i>Saint of Chains</i> is a <strong>psychological survival horror FPS\u00a0</strong>where the line between memory and reality dissolves. Every step drags you closer to the truth\u2026 and the dread buried within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/c45872ab178908c255ed27ea6b2275ac.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/c45872ab178908c255ed27ea6b2275ac.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/c45872ab178908c255ed27ea6b2275ac.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Move Quietly,\u00a0 Breathe Slowly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouch, <strong>jump-and-crouch</strong> \u2014 the classic trick from the <strong>old days</strong> \u2014 and drag your way through a decaying, impossible world that feeds on guilt, anxiety, neglect, and over-ambition. Every sound matters. Every breath betrays you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/90b50ca3062fdf53e26f292fb5912f43.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/90b50ca3062fdf53e26f292fb5912f43.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/90b50ca3062fdf53e26f292fb5912f43.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2a Hit Hard. Miss Once. Die Loud</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pipes. Guns. Axes</strong>. Panic. Every fight is ugly - loud - desperate. Scarce ammo boxes lie half-empty in the dark. <strong>You\u2019re no hero</strong>. You\u2019re just trying to survive what\u2019s left of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a0878599dfb17d85791b3513f4375449.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a0878599dfb17d85791b3513f4375449.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/a0878599dfb17d85791b3513f4375449.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Think Like a Victim. Solve Like It\u2019s the Only Way Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted locks. <strong>Cryptic clues</strong>. Cold statues, and the sick logic of the damned and the unforgiven. Some puzzles open doors. Others open memories you swore you\u2019d buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/caa8b072eb7d44df0154be44bb957de8.poster.avif?t=1760720910\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/caa8b072eb7d44df0154be44bb957de8.webm?t=1760720910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079340/extras/caa8b072eb7d44df0154be44bb957de8.mp4?t=1760720910\" type=\"vide